A||||23||Mickey_Moose||WS6 Suspension||||5||
Z||000000||Mickey_Moose||09-03-2001||11:06 PM||||how does one tell if the car is equiped with the WS6 suspension package? Things that you can tell by looking at it.<P>thanks<BR>Tim<BR>||||reg||5
